Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: all Senators except the Senate President and the ex-official members

asr-000012
00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:21.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: all were elected as regular members of the committee on June 17, 2026.

asr-000013
00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:25.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Further, August 24, 2026, the following senators were designated

asr-000014
00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:27.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: as Chairpersons of the committee and will work

asr-000015
00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:33.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: with the committee on sponsoring the budget of the respective assigned agencies.

asr-000016
00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:38.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senators Bam Aquino, Senators Pia Cayetano, Senators Christopher Lorenz-Bongo,

asr-000017
00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:44.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senators Risa Ontiveros, Senators Loren Legarda, Senators Francis Kiko Pangilinan,

asr-000018
00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:49.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senators Erwin Tulfo, and Senators Joel Villanueva.

asr-000019
00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:52.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At this juncture, let me direct the Committee's Secretary

asr-000020
