asr-000201
00:22:28.220 --> 00:22:38.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Roads, bridges, flood control, irrigation, railways, ports, and other infrastructure must form part of one coherent plan based on the actual needs and long-term development of the country.

asr-000202
00:22:39.780 --> 00:22:46.500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At the same time, agriculture and food security must be forgotten.

asr-000203
