Senator Imee R. Marcos: what contingency measures are we undertaking and are apparent in the 2027 budget in the event that oil crisis once exceed the assumed range?

asr-006492
06:04:40.500 --> 06:04:42.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I think it's $90.

asr-006493
06:04:43.200 --> 06:04:44.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Is that correct?

asr-006494
06:04:44.900 --> 06:04:47.080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So what happens then?

asr-006495
06:04:47.420 --> 06:04:52.380
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Are we going to restudy all of this?

asr-006496
06:04:53.640 --> 06:04:58.560
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Are there any measures we're undertaking to defray?

asr-006497
06:04:59.740 --> 06:05:02.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Are we going to increase in the oil prices?

asr-006498
06:05:03.000 --> 06:05:08.160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: There are two pesos that are rising again, the gasoline, so a lot of people are asking.

asr-006499
06:05:08.960 --> 06:05:12.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And the war we think will end, I don't think it will end.

asr-006500
06:05:13.620 --> 06:05:21.160
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Mr. Chair, Your Honor, one thing that the DOE has started implementing, taking off from the Middle East crisis,

asr-006501
06:05:21.160 --> 06:05:29.160
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: was to start stockpiling on oil as well as to explore additional storage so that we can increase the...

asr-006502
06:05:29.740 --> 06:05:35.280
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: storage capacity of the country so that we will not be that very much susceptible to any shocks.

