asr-007900
07:28:08.440 --> 07:28:15.700
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: But previous to that, in 2025, it was the only time that we did not hit our target, I think.

asr-007901
07:28:16.260 --> 07:28:18.260
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: But previous to that, we were hitting our targets.

asr-007902
07:28:18.920 --> 07:28:24.040
