asr-007908
07:28:47.540 --> 07:28:51.540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And I'm sure yung preso ng gasolina kasi, o crudo, tumaas eh.

asr-007909
07:28:52.100 --> 07:28:55.480
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: Yes, but still, there are difficulties in the volume pa rin po naman.

asr-007910
07:28:56.600 --> 07:28:57.960
