asr-007918
07:29:29.380 --> 07:29:36.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: It's important to meet the targets because, like I said, we're pressing DOF to reduce borrowing.

asr-007919
07:29:36.160 --> 07:29:38.220
