asr-007923
07:29:50.200 --> 07:29:56.620
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: We address that by subscribing to publications.

asr-007924
07:29:56.620 --> 07:29:59.980
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: There are publications that we subscribe to.

asr-007925
07:30:00.000 --> 07:30:07.600
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: subscribed to that reflect actual prices of commodities these prices are the ones that we

asr-007926
07:30:07.600 --> 07:30:14.580
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: use to question some undervalued items that are being brought into the country so by way of that

asr-007927
07:30:14.580 --> 07:30:21.820
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: we were able to efficiently collect some of the items that we feel we needed to adjust

asr-007928
07:30:21.820 --> 07:30:28.000
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: in terms of at least questioning the transaction value more than that we also needed to

asr-007929
07:30:28.000 --> 07:30:37.360
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: have a workaround on our system and try to improve trade facilitation because if

asr-007930
07:30:37.360 --> 07:30:42.520
