Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: you mean in subscription and because of the subscription like improving collection

asr-007932
07:30:49.760 --> 07:30:55.800
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: in your honors we've been doing it for the past years but we've expanded it no in fact if you

asr-007933
07:30:55.800 --> 07:30:57.860
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: look at our budget there's

asr-007934
07:30:57.860 --> 07:30:57.980
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: some of the items that we've been collecting for the past years and we've expanded it for the past

asr-007935
07:30:57.980 --> 07:31:06.180
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: specific proposals for specific subscription fees on major items that we look into and these

asr-007936
07:31:06.180 --> 07:31:12.500
BOC Assistant Commissioner Vincent Philip C. Maronilla: are these major items are the drivers of our imports these are the top imports that we look

asr-007937
07:31:12.500 --> 07:31:18.980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: into and they're the drivers of our collection so BIR and any what are the reforms that you are

asr-007938
07:31:18.980 --> 07:31:27.040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: doing in order to improve collection efficiency your honor for the BIR

asr-007939
07:31:27.980 --> 07:31:33.620
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: for the past year as shown in the screen we're really having difficulty in attaining the goal

asr-007940
07:31:35.380 --> 07:31:43.860
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: some factors is because of not be able not able to achieve the expected projection as as computed

asr-007941
07:31:43.860 --> 07:31:52.420
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: but however for this year january to july so far we are on target in fact january to july

asr-007942
07:31:52.420 --> 07:31:57.460
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: cumulatively we are we exceeded the goal so we're up by

asr-007943
07:31:57.980 --> 07:32:04.180
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: hundred point twelve actually percent a little over two billion but in terms of enforcement

asr-007944
07:32:04.180 --> 07:32:11.780
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: activity we've been continuing with a run after fake transactions rough cases we've been filing

asr-007945
07:32:11.780 --> 07:32:19.120
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: DOJ cases pursuing cases that are endorsed to us by other enforcement agencies like endorsements

asr-007946
07:32:19.120 --> 07:32:27.460
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: from the flood control cases the we have been pursuing that the pogo cases and other informers

asr-007947
07:32:27.980 --> 07:32:38.180
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: cases big ticket at that that are being endorsed to us we are also doing tax verification drive this is making expand

asr-007948
07:32:38.180 --> 07:32:44.560
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: taxpayers base making sure that all those doing business are really registered in the database but the

asr-007949
07:32:44.560 --> 07:32:52.260
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: approach we're taking now is more on the friendly approach educating the taxpayer making them comply giving

asr-007950
07:32:52.260 --> 07:32:56.960
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: them the opportunity to comply and if not that's when we enforce

asr-007951
07:32:56.960 --> 07:32:57.980
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: the law

asr-007952
07:32:57.980 --> 07:33:01.940
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: by imposing the off-land kandado or closure

asr-007953
07:33:01.940 --> 07:33:06.500
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: to force them to comply with the requirements

asr-007954
07:33:06.500 --> 07:33:08.000
BIR Deputy Commissioner Marissa O. Cabreros: in the BIR and impose penalty.

asr-007955
07:33:10.300 --> 07:33:12.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Argo, meron bang internally,

asr-007956
07:33:12.680 --> 07:33:15.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: do you have any disciplinary action

asr-007957
07:33:15.500 --> 07:33:20.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: or any way of compelling the two agencies

asr-007958
07:33:20.460 --> 07:33:21.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to meet their targets?

asr-007959
07:33:21.780 --> 07:33:24.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Or do you have any covenant

asr-007960
07:33:24.180 --> 07:33:26.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: na pag hindi mo tinamahan itong target na ito,

asr-007961
07:33:26.800 --> 07:33:27.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: lagot ka?

